<view class="legal-page">
  <view class="legal-bg"></view>
  <view class="legal-content">
    <view class="legal-card">
      <text class="legal-kicker">Privacy</text>
      <text class="legal-heading">Haimi Power Privacy Policy</text>
      <text class="legal-meta">Updated: 2026-07-01</text>
      <text class="legal-p">Operator: Beijing Haimilai Technology Co., Ltd. Contact: qq13238367306@163.com.</text>
      <text class="legal-p">We process WeChat account identifiers, login credentials, and session identifiers for sign-in, account recognition, and security authentication. OpenID and UnionID are stored only on the server and are not displayed in the mini program frontend.</text>
      <text class="legal-p">If you choose password login, we process your account name or email identifier. Passwords are stored only as irreversible hashes and are never stored or returned in plain text.</text>
      <text class="legal-p">The daily mood is generated automatically. Signed-in users have the mood ID and generation time saved on the server so the same result appears throughout the day. Guest users use a temporary local identifier for the same daily display. This feature does not collect manually entered mood content.</text>
      <text class="legal-p">Period start dates, cycle length, duration, and reference records are sensitive physiological cycle records. They are stored locally only, are not uploaded to the server, are not backed up, and are not synced. You can clear them at any time from the period page or Settings. Uninstalling the app or clearing cache may cause data loss.</text>
      <text class="legal-p">Device window and status bar information are used only for layout adaptation. Service logs are used only for security auditing and troubleshooting, retained for 180 days, and do not record keys, login credentials, or period records.</text>
      <text class="legal-p">We do not collect phone numbers, location, photos, camera, microphone, contacts, clipboard, address, or payment information.</text>
      <text class="legal-p">You may request access, correction, or deletion of personal information, withdraw consent, or close your account. Account and personal information deletion requests will be completed within 15 business days.</text>
      <text class="legal-p">Users under 14 should use the product with guardian consent and guidance. This product is not actively provided to children and does not actively collect children's personal information.</text>
      <text class="legal-p">All content is for personal records and display reference only. It is not professional advice and does not represent a confirmed result.</text>
    </view>
    <button wx:if="{{consentMode}}" class="agree-btn" bindtap="acceptAndGoBack">Agree and return</button>
  </view>
</view>
